@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About — The Camera Captures</PageTitle>
<MetaTags Description="Meet the photographer behind The Camera Captures." />

<section class="page-hero about-page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> BEHIND THE LENS</p>
    <h4>Curious eyes.<br /><em>Open heart..</em><br /><em>Best Memories...</em></h4>
    <p>Photography is my way of paying attention — to light, to people, and to the stories unfolding around us.</p>
</section>

<section class="about-story section">
    <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/Images/thirdEye_H.jpeg" alt="Camera and photography equipment" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="image-caption">ALWAYS LOOKING A LITTLE CLOSER</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">HELLO, I'M THE PHOTOGRAPHER</p>
        <h2>There’s a story<br />in <em>every frame.</em></h2>
        <p>I'm a photographer based in New Jersey, drawn to portraits with personality, landscapes with atmosphere, and city streets that never stand still.</p>
        <p>My approach is simple: stay curious, look for the light, and make photographs that feel as good years from now as they did in the moment.</p>
        <p>This site is a growing visual journal of the people I meet and the places that stay with me. Thanks for being here.</p>
        <a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Work with me <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="values-strip">
    <div><span>01</span><h3>Honest moments</h3><p>Natural expressions over perfect poses.</p></div>
    <div><span>02</span><h3>Thoughtful light</h3><p>Finding the feeling in every scene.</p></div>
    <div><span>03</span><h3>Lasting stories</h3><p>Images you’ll want to return to.</p></div>
</section>
